%% G. End-to-end sequence — one session from start to report
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Web as Next.js UI
  participant API as FastAPI /api/v1
  participant Intake as intake (graph + ranker)
  participant Docs as documents (PyMuPDF + verifier)
  participant LLM as LLMClient → Gemini
  participant Engine as engine / scenarios / counterfactual
  participant Explain as explain (templates + gate)
  participant DB as SQLite

  User->>Web: Start, accept privacy notice
  Web->>API: POST /sessions
  API->>DB: create session (token hashed)
  API-->>Web: session_id, token

  loop Adaptive intake until stop
    Web->>API: GET /sessions/{id}/next-question
    API->>Intake: rank candidates (partial compute via Engine)
    Intake->>Engine: compute at low/high bounds
    Engine-->>Intake: sensitivity
    Intake-->>API: QuestionCandidate + why_we_ask
    API-->>Web: question
    User->>Web: answer (typed or free text)
    Web->>API: POST /answers
    alt free text
      API->>LLM: parse (JSON schema)
      LLM-->>API: facts or malformed
      API-->>Web: facts, or fallback widget
    end
    API->>DB: append facts
  end

  User->>Web: upload contract
  Web->>API: POST /documents (multipart)
  API->>Docs: validate, text layer, redact
  Docs->>LLM: structured extraction with quotes
  LLM-->>Docs: LoanDocumentExtraction
  Docs->>Engine: payment / APR checks
  Docs-->>API: VerifiedFinancialTerm[] (checks)
  API->>DB: store terms, delete raw file
  Web->>API: GET /documents/{doc_id} (poll)
  API-->>Web: verification table
  User->>Web: confirm / edit terms
  Web->>API: POST /documents/{doc_id}/verify
  API-->>Web: LoanOffer ready_for_calculation

  Web->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/analysis (Idempotency-Key)
  API->>Engine: compute, run_catalog, evaluate
  Engine-->>API: results
  API->>Explain: build plans + templates
  Explain-->>API: ExplanationSection[] (template_text)
  API->>DB: store DecisionReport
  API-->>Web: DecisionReport
  Web-->>User: dashboard with provenance chips

  opt Narrative wording
    Web->>API: POST /reports/{id}/explain (section_id)
    API->>Explain: narrate (LLM #3) then validate
    Explain->>LLM: plan → text
    LLM-->>Explain: text
    Explain-->>API: narrative or template fallback
    API-->>Web: section update
  end

  User->>Web: delete my data
  Web->>API: DELETE /sessions/{id}
  API->>DB: purge all rows for session
